Package: authelia-admin
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Maintainer: @MAINTAINER@
Depends: adduser, libc6 (>= 2.36), libstdc++6
Homepage: https://github.com/digennarot/authelia-admin
Description: Web administration interface for Authelia
 Authelia Admin is a web control panel for managing an Authelia
 deployment: TOTP configurations, banned users and IPs, and users and
 groups in LLDAP.
 .
 The package ships its own Node.js runtime, so it does not depend on
 the system nodejs package. The native sqlite3 module is built together
 with that runtime.
